 G5: documented that the API has no enum parameter, and probed out-of-range surplus scalar args (`-1`, `i32::MIN/MAX`) across the FFI boundary.\n\n## Phase D — parity, configs, and a negative control\n- `Cargo.toml` has no `[features]`, C has no `#ifdef`/`option()` ⇒ one configuration; `run_all.sh` enumerates the feature power set generically and passed for default, `--no-default-features`, `--all-features`, and `--release` (`panic=\"abort\"`, same single symbol exported).\n- **Harness validated by mutation**: injecting a `len-1` `memcpy` bug into the Rust source made 4+ tests fail, proving the tests really exercise the loaded Rust `.so`; the original was restored byte-identically.\n\nNo divergences were found — the Rust translation matches the C ground truth. `c_src/` was not modified; only `libloading`/`libc` dev-dependencies were added to `Cargo.toml`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":772,"cache_read_input_tokens":67147,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":772,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81dfe8e0-42c2-4afc-9089-8dea95a8ea8b","uuid":"eeb62345-0e39-4755-bec4-c5257050f612","timestamp":"2026-08-20T16:17:41.596Z"}
